# takefrom-printer regression (synthetic, v2 format). The worker draws at the
# printer's front square, walks rejects over to the shredder's front square and
# feeds them there -- machines are used from their front square alone, so the
# reject run is a two-step shuttle, the same shape the shredder-and-printer
# levels use. Exercises: takefrom on a printer (fresh random cube), the errand
# walk to a machine front, giveto shredder, randomized trials, and the
# all_holding_min win check.
name Printer Take
dim 4 3
ent shredder 1 2
ent printer 2 2
ent worker 2 1
goal all_holding_min 50
